# Battle against Tapu Fini (Poni's guardian, water): the guardians' tom pattern and horn call over rippling harp,
# then a slow-moving D-major vibraphone line, clouded by C-major chords, over a misty pad and a dark contrabass:
# calm on top, dangerous underneath. Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Tapu Fini
tempo 156
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.08
reverb 0.4

track lead vibraphone lowhp=sawlead vol=0.82 pan=0 rev=0.36
  r1 | r1 |
  L o5 f+2 e4 d4 | o5 e2. g4 | o5 b2 a4 g4 | o5 a2. r4 |
  o5 f+2 d4 o4 b4 | o5 c2 e4 g4 | o5 b2 a4 g4 | o5 e2 c+4 e4 |
  o5 a4. b8 a4 f+4 | o5 g4. e8 g4 o6 c4 | o6 d2 o5 b4 g4 | o5 g2 e4 b4 |
  o5 d4. e8 f+4 b4 | o5 b4. a8 g4 d4 | o5 f+1 | o5 a1 |

# The guardians' horn call: the tonic, a leap to the fifth, the pentatonic step above it and back, then the tonic an octave up
track horn horn vol=0.48 pan=-0.2 rev=0.36
  o4 d8 a4. b8 a8 o5 d4 | o5 d2. r4 |
  L r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 |
  r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 | o4 d8 a4. b8 a8 o5 d4 | o5 d2. r4 |

